					<h2 data-interaction-id="44e03f8" class="e-44e03f8-9c56304 e-heading-base e-default-h2">Hindustan Scouts &amp; Guides.<br></h2>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55c629b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="55c629b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<div class="row sa-row"><div class="col-sm sa-col"><p>​​<span lang="EN-US">As part of our mission to foster character development and nurture responsible citizens, MGM Model School, Ayiroor, Varkala has partnered with Hindustan Scouts and Guides Kerala since 2019.</span></p></div></div><div class="row sa-row"><div class="col-sm sa-col"><p>​<i>​Our School proudly hosts:</i></p></div></div>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5a16a8c elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="5a16a8c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items">
							<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z"></path></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">1 Scout Troop </span>
									</li>
								<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z"></path></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">​1 Guide Company</span>
									</li>
								<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z"></path></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text"> ​1 Rover-Ranger unit</span>
									</li>
						</ul>
						</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5596423 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5596423" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<div class="row sa-row"><div class="col-sm sa-col"><div class="row sa-row"><div class="col-sm sa-col"><p>​​<span lang="EN-US">Under the guidance of trained instructors &#8211; Mr. Pravin S R and Mr. Binukumar C,126 cadets are actively engaged in scouting activities. Notably, 31 cadets have earned the prestigious Rajyapuraskar (Governor&#8217;s Award) over the past five years.</span></p></div></div><div class="row sa-row"><div class="col-sm sa-col"> </div></div></div></div>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
