					<h2 data-interaction-id="44e03f8" class="e-44e03f8-9c56304 e-heading-base e-default-h2">​<strong>Introducing Our Swimming Pool Facility!</strong><br></h2>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55c629b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="55c629b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-weight: 400;">We&#8217;re excited to announce the addition of a state-of-the-art swimming pool to our campus, designed to enhance physical fitness and provide a new dimension to our students&#8217; educational experience.</p><p style="font-weight: 400;">Our facility features two pools, including one exclusively for children under 8 years old. The pools are designed and constructed with the highest safety standards in mind, and our well-trained and qualified trainers will provide expert guidance.</p><p style="font-weight: 400;">Our comprehensive swimming program for children will cover the following skills and strokes:</p>								</div>
