		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-70902a8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="70902a8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b409e14 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b409e14" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Investiture Ceremony</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9167be2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9167be2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									Our school&#8217;s Investiture Ceremony is a time-honoured tradition where student leaders are chosen
through a selective interview process to take on key roles as Head Boy and Head Girl, Deputy Head
Boy / Head Girl. These student leaders play a vital role in maintaining discipline, leading morning
assemblies and supporting various school events. By shouldering these responsibilities, they gain
invaluable experience and opportunities to develop essential leadership skills. The Investiture
Ceremony, held during a special school assembly, marks the formal handing over of responsibilities
to these newly elected office bearers, as they embark on their journey to shape the school&#8217;s future.
								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8c5efd4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="8c5efd4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
