					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Amma School</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ab1756f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ab1756f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									Amma School was established with the noble aim of empowering parents with the knowledge and
skills to raise confident and resilient children. In today&#8217;s fast-paced world, children face numerous
challenges that require guidance and support. Through Amma School, we strive to create awareness
among parents about the various issues adolescents encounter and provide them with practical
strategies to nurture their children into responsible citizens. Our awareness classes are expertly
conducted by renowned social workers, psychiatrists, doctors and other specialists. The Amma
School program is held every second Saturday and was inaugurated by Sri. Udit Chaithanya, marking
the beginning of a journey to foster positive change in our community								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-de87e14 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="de87e14" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
