			<div class="tp-section tp-el-section mb-40 align-box wow fadeInRight" data-wow-duration="1.3s" data-wow-delay="0.3s">

									<h5 class="tp-section-subtitle tp-el-subtitle">
						About Us					</h5>
				
				<h3 class="tp-section-title tp-el-acadia-title tp-el-title">A Legacy of Excellence<br> 
                              <span> Since 1983 <svg width="180" height="13" viewbox="0 0 180 13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                 <path d="M173.163 12.3756C97.1838 -3.8242 30.6496 5.67799 7.32494 12.2553C5.30414 12.8252 2.43544 12.6722 0.917529 11.9135C-0.600387 11.1549 -0.192718 10.0779 1.82808 9.50807C27.5427 2.25675 98.002 -7.60121 177.683 9.38783C179.881 9.85641 180.65 10.9051 179.402 11.7301C178.154 12.5552 175.361 12.8442 173.163 12.3756Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                                 </svg>
                              </span></h3>
							</div>

						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-682bbbae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="682bbbae" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<blockquote><p><strong>&#8220;Success is not about being the best. It&#8217;s about being better than you were yesterday.”</strong></p></blockquote><p>MGM Model School&#8217;s 41-year journey began in 1983 with five students, founded by dedicated social workers under Aikya Pradayini Trust&#8217;s patronage. The late Padma Shri Prem Nazir laid the foundation stone. The school offers classes from Standard I to XII, along with pre-school, play school, and Kids School programs. The Kids International School, inaugurated by Education Minister Shri Abdu Rabb in 2012, is a notable addition.</p><p>From humble beginnings in a small rented building, MGM Model School has grown into a full-fledged institution with cutting-edge facilities, including an Innovation Lab, three digital libraries, an audio recording studio, a giant globe, swimming pools, and a 3D Maths Zone. These resources foster curiosity and interest in learning among our <strong>2,700+</strong> students from pre-primary to senior secondary.</p><p>Our institution strives to provide <strong>international-standard</strong> education, leveraging modern technologies and techniques to promote all-round development, character-building, and 21st-century skills. We also offer opportunities for community service, instilling values in our students.</p><p>Notable events include the Silver Jubilee celebrations, inaugurated by Kerala Governor Shri R. L. Bhatia in 2007 and valedicted by former President Dr. A. P. J. Abdul Kalam. His equation for knowledge—<strong>creativity + righteousness + courage</strong>—has become a guiding principle for our creative and <strong>value-based</strong> learning approach.</p><p>We&#8217;re honored that our innovative <strong>20-20</strong> methodology, initiated by Trust Secretary Dr. P. K. Sukumaran, was acknowledged and appreciated by Kerala Governor Shri Arif Mohammed Khan. Our team of qualified and dedicated teachers <strong>provide</strong> stimulating education, adhering to Mahatma Gandhi&#8217;s principles and values.</p><p>Our motto is <strong>the nation&#8217;s reconstruction and integration</strong>, and we spare no effort in upholding these ideals.</p>								</div>
